ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp187: PLANE-hosted edge: 3D LINE (0,0,0)->(1,0,0), uniform domain [0,1]. PCURVE: degree-3 B-spline, 7 non-collinear control points tracing a gentle S-wiggle (0,0)->(1,0) in UV, interior knots (0.0001,0.0002,0.0003) -- smallest:largest knot-interval ratio ~1:10000, ill-conditioned spacing that defeats polynomial-domain SameParameter approximation and forces arc-length (curvilinear) reparametrization */
